 "Liquids & Gels":{identity:"a contained liquid suspension or viscoelastic fluid whose shape is governed by gravity, surface tension, viscosity and any stated field or stimulus",micro:"show a coherent continuous liquid surface, suspended particles or gel network; avoid disconnected floating fragments",process:"resolve containment, flow, settling, field alignment or shear response using the source vessel and geometry",behaviour:"respect gravity, viscosity, surface tension, meniscus, containment and stimulus-dependent changes in rheology",optics:"use liquid reflections, refraction and depth consistent with opacity and particle concentration",limits:"do not make a fluid behave like a solid metal, allow it to leave its vessel or create unsupported spikes or droplets"},
